```

### 2. **Functional Utility**

```css
/* [!code filename:CSS] */
@theme {
  --tab-size-2: 2;
  --tab-size-4: 4;
  --tab-size-github: 8;
}

@utility tab-* {
  /* prettier-ignore */
  tab-size: --value(--tab-size-*);
}
```

Usage: `tab-2`, `tab-4`, `tab-github`, or `tab-[76]` (arbitrary values with `--value([integer])`)

### 3. **Variants on Custom Utilities**

Custom utilities **automatically work with all variants**:

```html
