<div class="hover:content-auto"><!-- ... --></div>

<!-- Responsive variant (lg, md, etc.) -->
<div class="lg:content-auto"><!-- ... --></div>

<!-- Combined -->
<div class="lg:hover:content-auto"><!-- ... --></div>
```

The documentation states: *"It will also work with variants like `hover`, `focus` and `lg`"* and *"Custom utilities are automatically inserted into the `utilities` layer along with all of the built-in utilities in the framework."*

